# Jordan's job search

By the end of my first week I had four companies on my list, and had applied to three of them. Each company holds my applications to it, so the list of companies is the list of everywhere I have applied. Each application keeps the CV and cover letter I sent: I have two versions of my CV, one for project manager roles and one for PMO roles.

GreenGrid Networks has no stage yet, so it starts as Interested.

JobSearch: Project manager in renewable energy|Project Manager|65000|2026-10-05|2027-01-31|15000|3200
    Companies:
    * Solaris Energy|Solar farms and battery storage|https://example.com/solaris/careers
        Applications:
        * Project Manager, Grid Connections|Applied|2026-10-08|64000|5
            CV: [CV for project manager roles](cv/jordan-reyes-project-manager.pdf)
            CoverLetter: [Cover letter for Solaris Energy](letters/solaris-energy.pdf)
